      "title": "Algorithm 4 Asynchronous Advantage Actor-Critic (A3C)\n1: initialize the actor network with random weights \u03b8\n0\nin the master thread.\nthread n.\n3: repeat\n4: for each thread n do\n6: initialize step counter t\nn \u2190 0\n7: while episode not finished do\n8: choose y\nn\nt+1 according to P(y\nn\nt+1|Y\nn\nt\n, Xn\nt\n; \u03b8\nn)\n9: observe new state Xn\nt+1;\n10: observe one-step reward Rn\nt = R(Y\nn\nt\n, Xn\nt\n)\n11: let An\nt =\n\nRn\nt + V (Xn\nt+1; \u03c6) \u2212 V (Xn\nt\n; \u03c6)\n\n12: d\u03b80 \u2190 d\u03b80 + \u2207\u03b8An\nt\nlog P(y\nn\nt+1|Y\nn\nt\n, Xn\nt\n; \u03b8\nn)\n2",
